Description: Add native Wi-Fi Direct GO and credential client support
 Extend wifi-p2p profiles with autonomous group creation and frequency selection.
 Manage groups through NetworkManager activation and shared IP configuration,
 and expose credentials through an ACL- and Polkit-authorized device method.
Origin: other, local crQuickShare development
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-15

